{"step_index":3258,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-28T17:28:33Z","input_tokens":3890,"cache_read_tokens":219612,"output_tokens":5727,"thinking":"Updating the specified lines with the provided style modifications. The objective is to adjust text and card sizes within the designated section. The changes address font sizes for various text elements and adjust the layout and padding of a card component.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Increase font size for variable boxes, numbers, and calculation stage in styles.css","EndLine":1125,"Instruction":"Scale up variable values, numbers, equations, and calculation chips in styles.css","ReplacementContent":".teach-why-text {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.55;\n  color: #166534;\n}\n\n.teach-why-text code {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  background: #dcfce7;\n  padding: 2px 7px;\n  border-radius: 5px;\n  color: #14532d;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   PHASE 2 & PHASE 3: VISUAL VARIABLE BOXES, ANIMATIONS,\n   CONDITIONS & LOOP TRACKERS\n   ========================================================= */\n\n/* 1. Labeled Variable Box Cards */\n.var-boxes-grid {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 8px;\n  align-items: stretch;\n}\n\n.var-box-card {\n  flex: 1 1 95px;\n  max-width: 160px;\n  min-height: 52px;\n  border: 2px solid var(--border-medium);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  background: #ffffff;\n  padding: 6px 10px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);\n  transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;\n  position: relative;\n  animation: varCardPop calc(0.35s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) ease-out;\n}\n\n.var-box-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n  box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);\n}\n\n.var-box-label {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 4px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.var-box-label strong {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  color: var(--primary-blue);\n  background: #eff6ff;\n  border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;\n  padding: 1px 5px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.var-status-badge {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 1px 6px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n}\n\n.var-status-badge.is-created {\n  background: #dbeafe;\n  color: #1d4ed8;\n  border: 1px solid #93c5fd;\n  animation: popIn calc(0.3s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) ease;\n}\n\n.var-status-badge.is-updated {\n  background: #d1fae5;\n  color: #047857;\n  border: 1px solid #6ee7b7;\n  animation: popIn calc(0.3s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) ease;\n}\n\n.var-status-badge.is-negative {\n  background: #fee2e2;\n  color: #b91c1c;\n  border: 1px solid #fca5a5;\n  animation: shake calc(0.5s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) ease;\n}\n\n.var-box-val-slot {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 4px;\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  min-height: 32px;\n}\n\n.var-box-value {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 19px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  animation: numPopIn calc(0.35s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);\n}\n\n.var-box-prev {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.var-box-card.is-created {\n  border-color: #3b82f6;\n  background: #eff6ff;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);\n  animation: varCreatedGlow calc(0.6s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) ease;\n}\n\n.var-box-card.is-updated {\n  border-color: #10b981;\n  background: #ecfdf5;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);\n  animation: varUpdatedGlow calc(0.6s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) ease;\n}\n\n.var-box-card.is-negative-warning {\n  border-color: #f43f5e;\n  background: #fff1f2;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.2);\n}\n\n.var-box-card.is-negative-warning .var-box-value {\n  color: #be123c;\n}\n\n/* 2. Number Moving Into Variable Stage (Phase 2) */\n.visual-calc-stage {\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.calc-stage-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.4px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.calc-stage-badge {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  background: #eff6ff;\n  color: #1d4ed8;\n  border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;\n}\n\n.assign-animation-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 10px;\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n\n.anim-source-val {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: #1e40af;\n  background: #dbeafe;\n  border: 1.5px solid #93c5fd;\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  animation: numberGlide calc(0.45s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n}\n\n.anim-move-arrow {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 5px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #2563eb;\n  letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n  animation: arrowGlide calc(0.8s * var(--anim-speed-factor, 1)) infinite alternate ease-